oing to be in for their delivery?",{"id":280,"href":281,"linkText":282},"YhzVjhIAAC0A7ZdP","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fwhat-can-i-do-if-the-person-im-sending-the-parcel-to-doesnt-want-it-any-more","What can I do if the person I'm sending the parcel to doesn't want it any more?",{"id":284,"href":285,"linkText":286},"aeCVyhEAACoAy-1P","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fpost-office-evri-parcel-help","I sent my parcel via the Post Office. Whom should I contact if something goes wrong?",{"id":288,"href":289,"linkText":290},"YhzZwxIAACsA7ar1","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-will-i-know-when-my-parcel-has-been-delivered","How will I know when my parcel has been delivered?",{"id":292,"href":293,"linkText":294},"YhzcfRIAACgA7bfb","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fcan-i-change-the-delivery-address-after-ive-sent-a-parcel","Can I change the delivery address after I've sent a parcel?",{"id":296,"href":297,"linkText":298},"YhzbIhIAAC4A7bFY","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-do-i-change-my-order-details","How do I change my order details?",{"id":300,"href":301,"linkText":302},"YhzbdBIAACkA7bLi","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-do-i-cancel-my-order","How do I cancel my order?",{"id":304,"href":305,"linkText":306},"YhzYgRIAACoA7aT5","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Finternational-deliveries","International deliveries",{"id":308,"href":309,"linkText":310},"aMKG1xIAACAAPQAR","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-to-contact-customer-services-for-international-parcels","How to contact customer services for international parcels",{"categoryUid":312,"categoryTitle":313,"linkedPages":314},"lockers","Lockers",[315,319,323,325,329,333],{"id":316,"href":317,"linkText":318},"YhzQ2hIAACkA7YHk","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fcan-i-get-my-parcel-delivered-to-a-locker","Can I get my parcel delivered to a Locker?",{"id":320,"href":321,"linkText":322},"YhzTYRIAAC4A7Y0l","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fthe-locker-is-too-small-for-my-parcel-what-can-i-do","The locker is too small for my parcel, what can I do?",{"id":324,"href":12,"linkText":8},"YhzT2BIAAC0A7Y9S",{"id":326,"href":327,"linkText":328},"YhzSehIAACkA7Yjg","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fim-having-trouble-with-the-locker-what-can-i-do","I'm having trouble with the Locker, what can I do?",{"id":330,"href":331,"linkText":332},"YhzRghIAACkA7YTp","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fhow-do-i-use-a-locker","How do I use a Locker?",{"id":334,"href":17,"linkText":14},"YhzS9RIAAC0A7Ysk","how-do-i-use-a-locker",{"titleTag":337,"metaDescription":338,"canonical":339,"subpath2":340,"category":349,"linkText":332,"additionalHelp":6,"slices":357},"How do I use a locker? | FAQs | Evri","Evri Lockers make collecting, sending and returning parcels quicker and easier than ever. Find out how they work and get sending today.","how-do-i-use-a-locker.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fhow-do-i-use-a-locker",{"id":341,"type":342,"tags":343,"lang":344,"slug":312,"first_publication_date":345,"last_publication_date":345,"uid":312,"link_type":346,"key":347,"isBroken":348},"Yhj0nxIAACkA3Cgw","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:24:19+0000","Document","65fbefe6-b920-494a-9593-56e2f5e73eac",false,{"id":350,"type":351,"tags":352,"lang":344,"slug":312,"first_publication_date":354,"last_publication_date":355,"uid":312,"link_type":346,"key":356,"isBroken":348},"YituGBEAACsAQzK1","faq-category",[353],"FAQs","2022-03-11T15:43:53+0000","2022-05-12T12:57:42+0000","b2fcc10f-771a-470c-931c-831cc2aee2c4",[358],{"variation":359,"version":360,"items":361,"primary":363,"id":486,"slice_type":487,"slice_label":488},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[362],{},{"content":364},[365,370,388,391,394,398,404,406,409,412,414,417,423,426,429,435,438,440,444,449,455,458,461,473,476],{"type":366,"text":367,"spans":368,"direction":369},"heading1","How do I use a Locker to send a parcel?",[],"ltr",{"type":371,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":369},"paragraph","Sending a parcel with one of our Lockers is quick, convenient, and can be done 24\u002F7 at most locations - perfect if you’re short on time.",[374,386],{"start":375,"end":376,"type":377,"data":378},33,40,"hyperlink",{"id":379,"type":380,"tags":381,"lang":344,"slug":382,"first_publication_date":383,"last_publication_date":384,"uid":312,"url":385,"link_type":346,"isBroken":348},"YhaXWhIAACwA0p3N","content-page",[157],"parcel-delivery--collection-lockers--collect-parcels--evri","2022-02-23T20:43:57+0000","2026-01-05T01:50:51+0000","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"start":375,"end":376,"type":387},"strong",{"type":371,"text":389,"spans":390,"direction":369},"Here’s how to get started: ",[],{"type":371,"text":392,"spans":393,"direction":369},"",[],{"type":395,"text":396,"spans":397,"direction":369},"heading3","Step 1: Book your parcel online or with the Evri app",[],{"type":371,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":369},"When you book your delivery, simply choose ‘Locker’ as your drop-off method. Don’t have a printer? No problem, many of our Lockers let you print your label on-site. You’ll receive a QR code after booking, which you can scan at the Locker to print there and then.",[401],{"start":402,"end":403,"type":387},43,51,{"type":371,"text":392,"spans":405,"direction":369},[],{"type":395,"text":407,"spans":408,"direction":369},"Step 2: Head to your chosen Locker",[],{"type":371,"text":410,"spans":411,"direction":369},"Use our Locker finder to locate the one that’s closest or most convenient for you. Most are outside local shops or supermarkets and are accessible 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.",[],{"type":371,"text":392,"spans":413,"direction":369},[],{"type":395,"text":415,"spans":416,"direction":369},"Step 3: Drop off your parcel",[],{"type":418,"text":419,"spans":420,"direction":369},"list-item","At the Locker screen, choose “Send a parcel”",[421],{"start":422,"end":402,"type":387},30,{"type":418,"text":424,"spans":425,"direction":369},"Scan your barcode or manually enter the 16-digit number we sent you ",[],{"type":418,"text":427,"spans":428,"direction":369},"A Locker door will pop open automatically. Simply place your parcel inside and close the door ",[],{"type":371,"text":430,"spans":431,"direction":369},"If the door that opens is too small, just tap “Too small” on the screen, and we’ll try to open a larger compartment (if one’s available). ",[432],{"start":433,"end":434,"type":387},47,56,{"type":371,"text":436,"spans":437,"direction":369},"If you drop your parcel off before 12pm, we’ll usually collect it the same day! ",[],{"type":371,"text":392,"spans":439,"direction":369},[],{"type":441,"text":442,"spans":443,"direction":369},"heading2","A few helpful tips: ",[],{"type":418,"text":445,"spans":446,"direction":369},"Each parcel must have its own booking and label - one parcel per Locker compartment ",[447],{"start":448,"end":433,"type":387},26,{"type":418,"text":450,"spans":451,"direction":369},"Make sure your parcel is securely packaged and clearly labelled ",[452],{"start":453,"end":454,"type":387},25,63,{"type":418,"text":456,"spans":457,"direction":369},"Sending more than one parcel? Repeat the process for each one \n ",[],{"type":441,"text":459,"spans":460,"direction":369},"Did you know?",[],{"type":371,"text":462,"spans":463,"direction":369},"You can also return parcels or collect deliveries from our Lockers, and with some retailers, you can even divert a parcel to a Locker on the day of delivery if you’re not going to be home. ",[464,467,470],{"start":465,"end":466,"type":387},13,27,{"start":468,"end":469,"type":387},31,49,{"start":471,"end":472,"type":387},106,133,{"type":371,"text":474,"spans":475,"direction":369},"Plus, if your preferred ParcelShop isn’t available, you can also drop off your parcel at a Locker, even when you chose a ParcelShop drop off at the time of booking. ",[],{"type":371,"text":477,"spans":478,"direction":369},"To learn more about all the ways you can use our Lockers - from printing labels to returning items - check out our full Locker guide. ",[479,485],{"start":480,"end":481,"type":377,"data":482},120,132,{"link_type":10,"url":483,"target":484},"how-do-i-use-a-locker.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers","_blank",{"start":480,"end":481,"type":387},"rich_text$4887e58e-cbbe-4d79-88ea-c1da1e8f96b1","rich_text",null,"Feb 28, 2022",["Reactive",491],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":492,"$sclients":559,"$sglobal-basket-count":488},{"abtasty":493,"accessibe":497,"appPromoBanner":500,"autoDivertUpdates":503,"awin":506,"bulkInternational":509,"bulkSendEnabled":512,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":515,"enableBasketCount":518,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":521,"euCustomsDuty":524,"groovyAdvert":527,"newInternationalSendFlow":530,"newinternationalpages":537,"oohPreferenceFlag":541,"opentel":544,"premium":547,"savedCards":550,"smallParcelSize":553,"yourPricesDrawer":556},{"_createdAt":494,"_updatedAt":495,"enabled":496},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":498,"_updatedAt":499,"enabled":496},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":501,"_updatedAt":502,"enabled":348},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":504,"_updatedAt":505,"enabled":348},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":507,"_updatedAt":508,"enabled":348},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":510,"_updatedAt":511,"enabled":496},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":513,"_updatedAt":514,"enabled":496},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_createdAt":516,"_updatedAt":517,"enabled":496},"2024-11-14T16:09:05.362Z","2024-11-21T10:37:32.927Z",{"_createdAt":519,"_updatedAt":520,"enabled":496},"2025-10-28T13:17:38.716Z","2026-04-14T10:49:05.879Z",{"_createdAt":522,"_updatedAt":523,"enabled":496},"2025-11-07T14:21:27.204Z","2026-05-14T12:54:05.701Z",{"_createdAt":525,"_updatedAt":526,"enabled":496},"2026-06-18T11:40:48.164Z","2026-06-30T